	<key>about_info</key>
	<string>A global volume wheel control tool.

When the mouse hovers over the dock area at the bottom of the screen, scrolling the wheel adjusts the system volume.
You can choose which output device to control from the menu.

Permissions:
• “Input Monitoring” — required, to observe the scroll wheel.
• “Accessibility” — optional; without it the app still works, but scroll events in the dock area are no longer swallowed (they also reach the window underneath).</string>
