	<key>permission_info</key>
	<string>VolumeWheel needs two separate permissions:

• Input Monitoring — System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Input Monitoring
  Required. Without it the app cannot see the scroll wheel at all.

• Accessibility — System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Accessibility
  Optional. Without it the app still works, but scrolling in the dock area also scrolls the window underneath instead of being swallowed.

Both permissions take effect immediately — no need to relaunch.</string>
